[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOnly Platform Administration may create/assign Level 99, assign platform-level roles, change a user organisation or administer across tenants. Organisation Manager may administer approved users/roles within their organisation, but cannot grant platform authority or transfer tenants. Project management cannot implicitly grant Commercial, Assurance or Plant-management powers. Treat role-code changes as authorisation changes as well as permission-map edits.[m
