[32m+[m[32m# Canonical Authority Enforcement - Bounded Phase 0 (2026-09-19)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mImplementation status: local rules and isolated tests added; no deployment or live[m
[32m+[m[32mmigration. Emulator execution is blocked by missing Java; security assertions are[m
[32m+[m[32mnot yet verified.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCanonical authority fields are organisationId, status, accessLevel, roleCode and[m
[32m+[m[32mpermissions. Role identifies function; explicit permissions grant capability;[m
[32m+[m[32mmembership defines project scope. Existing membership authority is accepted only[m
[32m+[m[32mwhen its UID and role match the current canonical profile; stale grants are inert. A matching numeric band is a validation[m
[32m+[m[32mrequirement, not inheritance of unrelated domain capabilities.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPlatform Admin requires ACTIVE, accessLevel 99 and roleCode PLATFORM_ADMIN.[m
[32m+[m[32mOrganisation Manager delegation requires ACTIVE, accessLevel 6,[m
[32m+[m[32mroleCode ORGANISATION_MANAGER, canManageUsers true and canManageOrganisation true.[m
[32m+[m[32mBoth use a valid canonical profile. Invalid role/level pairs confer no authority.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOnly Platform Admin can assign either administrative role, grant either[m
[32m+[m[32madministrative permission, transfer organisation, modify administrative profiles[m
[32m+[m[32mor delete user profiles. Tenant administration targets other eligible operational[m
[32m+[m[32musers in the same organisation; it cannot change the actor's own authority.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Fixed tenant grant ceilings[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThese are optional maximum grants, never automatic defaults. Omitted known[m
[32m+[m[32mpermission flags mean false; supplied flags must be booleans. Unknown permissions[m
[32m+[m[32mare rejected. Platform Admin may explicitly authorise known-capability exceptions;[m
[32m+[m[32mtenant administration cannot create an exception outside this table.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Target role | Level | Grantable organisation permissions | Grantable project permissions |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---:|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| WORKER | 0 | None | Ordinary membership |[m
[32m+[m[32m| SUPERVISOR | 1 | None | canUpdateOperations, canManageScopeProgress |[m
[32m+[m[32m| SITE_MANAGER | 2 | None | canUpdateOperations, canManageScopeProgress |[m
[32m+[m[32m| PROJECT_MANAGER | 3 | None | canUpdateOperations, canManageScopeProgress, canManageProject, canViewCommercial, canManageCommercial |[m
[32m+[m[32m| SENIOR_PROJECT_MANAGER | 4 | canViewAllProjects | Same project ceiling as PROJECT_MANAGER |[m
[32m+[m[32m| HEALTH_SAFETY | 4.5 | None | canManageAssurance |[m
[32m+[m[32m| SENIOR_HEALTH_SAFETY | 4.6 | canViewAllProjects, canManageAssurance | canManageAssurance |[m
[32m+[m[32m| CONTRACTS_MANAGER | 5 | canViewAllProjects, canCreateProjects, canViewCommercial, canManageCommercial | Same project ceiling as PROJECT_MANAGER |[m
[32m+[m[32m| PLANT_TRANSPORT_MANAGER | 5.5 | canViewAllProjects, canViewPlant, canRequestPlant, canManagePlant, canManageTransport | Ordinary membership; Plant management remains organisation-scoped |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCommercial management grants require Commercial viewing. Plant request/manage/[m
[32m+[m[32mtransport grants require explicit Plant viewing. Role changes must remove[m
[32m+[m[32mincompatible permissions. Normal project roles cannot receive organisation-wide[m
[32m+[m[32mPlant permissions from tenant administrators. HEALTH_SAFETY does not receive[m
[32m+[m[32morganisation-wide Assurance from this grant matrix.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProject managers with existing scoped canManageProject may administer ordinary[m
[32m+[m[32mmembership, including eligible operations/progress flags. They cannot grant[m
[32m+[m[32mcanManageProject or specialist capabilities. Both previous and proposed membership[m
[32m+[m[32mmust be ordinary, preventing specialist reactivation, replacement and deletion/[m
[32m+[m[32mrecreation. Ordinary membership excludes specialist/admin roles and management/[m
[32m+[m[32mCommercial/Assurance flags; its role must match the target user's canonical role.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMembership has an explicit field allowlist; unknown authority-like fields,[m
[32m+[m[32mpermissions maps, Plant-management flags and role overrides are rejected.[m
[32m+[m[32mTarget user, project and actor must have consistent tenant scope. Platform[m
[32m+[m[32madministration also validates membership shape and target/project tenant ownership.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTenant membership writes require an existing active eligible target profile.[m
[32m+[m[32mTarget authority must remain unchanged within the batch; combined role changes[m
[32m+[m[32mand membership grants are intentionally split into separate operations.[m
[32m+[m[32mActor authority is read from existing canonical data and cannot be changed by[m
[32m+[m[32manother write in a tenant-authorised batch.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Profile updates and migration boundary[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mActive users may change only their own nonempty displayName (maximum 120[m
[32m+[m[32mcharacters). Tenant administrators may update eligible users' displayName,[m
[32m+[m[32mACTIVE/INACTIVE status, allowed role/level/permission combinations and update[m
[32m+[m[32mmetadata. Identity, organisation and legacy fields are immutable to tenant actors.[m
[32m+[m[32mDeactivation replaces tenant profile deletion.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mNew profiles use canonical fields. Existing role and workspaceAccess can remain[m
[32m+[m[32munchanged temporarily but are never Firestore authority fallbacks.[m
[32m+[m[32mNo canAccessContractorWorkspace permission is introduced.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCurrent frontend dependencies remain in js/auth.js, shared shell.js/roles.js,[m
[32m+[m[32mPlant fleet.js/asset.js, and Project details.js; Documents consumes roles.js.[m
[32m+[m[32mThey require a separate coordinated frontend/data cutover. Inventory canonical[m
[32m+[m[32mfields, conflicts, role-only profiles, status and permissions before deployment.[m
[32m+[m[32mExisting numeric-only Platform Admins must be canonicalised first. Inventory[m
[32m+[m[32mmemberships for missing UID/role fields and stale role grants before deployment. No live[m
[32m+[m[32mrecords were inspected or migrated in this task.[m
